RESPONSIBILITIES:
&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Track new product launches across MF, PMS, AIFs, Structured Products.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a central repository of data, research, and collaterals.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Liaise with asset managers to form house views and provide inputs for product whitelisting.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Develop rationales for product approvals to the Investment Committee.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Maintain active touchpoints with fund managers, recording insights and updates.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Support Wealth Partners with product intelligence and joint calls.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;2-3 years in wealth/product research.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and financial writing skills.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Understanding of PMS, AIF, and structured products.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Relationship management capability with AMCs/fund houses.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;2-3 years in wealth/product teams at private banks or AMCs&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;

